    <bpmn:process id="W_W3362" name="W3362. Trade Association Leadership, Committee &amp; Board Representation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Leadership opportunity; committee cycle
Frequency: Per term/cycle
Volume: BuildRight representation across associations
Owner: Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs Mgr, Leadership/Executives (representatives), VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Source: workflow W3362 — Trade Association Leadership, Committee &amp; Board Representation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3362_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3362_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3362_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3362_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3362_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3362_Lane2" name="Representatives">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3362_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3362_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3362_Start4" name="Leadership opportunity; committee cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3362_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3362_Task5" name="Govt Affairs Mgr pursue and manage BuildRight leadership roles in associations…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs Mgr pursue and manage BuildRight leadership roles in associations (board seats, committee chairs, working-group leads) where strategically valuable; identify and nominate representatives
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / Leadership
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per term</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3362_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3362_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3362_Task6" name="Representatives participate actively (board/committee meetings, votes, working…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Representatives participate actively (board/committee meetings, votes, working groups), advance BuildRight and industry interests, and report insights back to BuildRight; Govt Affairs Mgr supports briefings
Responsible (R): Representatives / Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3362_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3362_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3362_Task7" name="Govt Affairs Mgr track BuildRight&#x27;s leadership footprint and influence, manage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs Mgr track BuildRight&#x27;s leadership footprint and influence, manage conflicts-of-interest (links to VS-86.3/W3275 in VS-100.3), and assess continuation of roles
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3362_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3362_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3362_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
