        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-542 (ensure controlled execution — Industry &amp; Trade Association Relations (PA-104.2).) | - operational: engagement tracking; operational: COI review
Owner: Government Affairs Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
