    <bpmn:process id="W_W3364" name="W3364. Peer-Retailer Benchmarking, Knowledge Exchange &amp; Industry Research" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Benchmarking need; complements VS-33.3/VS-44.2
Frequency: Periodic
Volume: Benchmarking studies/exchanges
Owner: Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs Mgr, Strategy (links to VS-33.3), Market Research (links to VS-44.2), affected SMEs, Legal (links to VS-86 antitrust)
Source: workflow W3364 — Peer-Retailer Benchmarking, Knowledge Exchange &amp; Industry Research</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3364_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3364_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3364_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3364_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3364_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3364_Lane2" name="SMEs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3364_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3364_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3364_Start4" name="Benchmarking need; complements VS-33.3/VS-44.2">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3364_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3364_Task5" name="Govt Affairs Mgr/Strategy identify benchmarking and knowledge-exchange…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs Mgr/Strategy identify benchmarking and knowledge-exchange opportunities via associations and peer networks (retail operations, supply chain, digital, sustainability, HR); scope within antitrust limits (links to VS-86)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per study</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3364_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3364_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3364_Task6" name="SMEs participate in exchanges/benchmarking studies, share non-proprietary…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: SMEs participate in exchanges/benchmarking studies, share non-proprietary practices, and capture insights (operations, technology, sustainability, people) for BuildRight improvement
Responsible (R): SMEs / Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per study</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3364_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3364_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
