      <bpmn:userTask id="W3368_Task4" name="Govt Affairs Mgr compile industry-relations performance: membership/sponsorship…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs Mgr compile industry-relations performance: membership/sponsorship ROI (W3367), leadership footprint (W3362), standard participation (W3363), benchmarking insights applied (W3364), event outcomes (W3365), and influence on policy (W3355)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
