        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs Mgr/Leadership assess BuildRight&#x27;s industry standing and influence vs objectives, identify gaps and opportunities, and adjust the industry-relations strategy
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / Leadership
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3368_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
